  "conclusion": "The frozen Yabause software renderer executes an entire VDP1 draw synchronously in host code and sets CEF/DrawEnd immediately, without consuming a modeled VDP1 raster cycle budget. Pixel area affects host work, but cannot establish physical VDP1 timing or explain emulated SH-2 deadline misses in this core. Yaul AUTO vdp1_sync_wait waits its VBlankOut software flag; its elapsed time is not a GPU busy duration."
